        'Your pregnancy journey'=>'Urugendo rwo gutwita','A simple guide to what to expect, what to do, and when to get care — from early pregnancy to after birth.'=>'Ubuyobozi bugufasha kumenya ibyo witega, ibyo wakora n’igihe cyo gushaka ubuvuzi kuva utangiye gutwita kugeza nyuma yo kubyara.','Your current stage'=>'Igihe ugezeho','Show my progress by'=>'Reba uko inda imaze igihe','weeks pregnant'=>'by’ibyumweru utwite','Pregnancy dating and milestones are estimates. Your care team can confirm what applies to you.'=>'Igihe inda imaze n’ibihe by’ingenzi ni ibigereranyo. Itsinda ry’ubuzima ryakwemeza amakuru akureba.','Pregnancy trimesters'=>'Ibihembwe byo gutwita','Weeks 1–12'=>'Ibyumweru 1–12','Weeks 13–27'=>'Ibyumweru 13–27','Weeks 28–40'=>'Ibyumweru 28–40','Early pregnancy and major development.'=>'Intangiriro yo gutwita n’iterambere rikomeye.','Your care team can help arrange your first antenatal contact and discuss recommended checks.'=>'Itsinda ry’ubuzima ryagufasha gutegura gusura ikigo nderabuzima bwa mbere no kuganira ku bipimo bikenewe.','Your pregnancy continues to change and grow.'=>'Inda yawe ikomeza gukura no guhinduka.','Keep scheduled antenatal contacts and ask your care team about recommended checks.'=>'Komeza gusura ikigo nderabuzima nk’uko wabiteganyirijwe kandi ubaze itsinda ry’ubuzima ku bipimo bikenewe.','Preparing for birth and your baby’s arrival.'=>'Kwitegura kubyara no kwakira umwana.','Discuss birth preparedness, where to go, and when to seek urgent care with your care team.'=>'Ganira n’itsinda ry’ubuzima ku myiteguro yo kubyara, aho uzajya n’igihe cyo gushaka ubuvuzi bwihutirwa.','You are here'=>'Ugeze aha','Key checkups (antenatal care)'=>'Igenzura ry’ingenzi (kwisuzumisha inda)','Book and attend antenatal care contacts as advised by your health worker.'=>'Teganya kandi ujye kwisuzumisha inda nk’uko umukozi w’ubuzima yakugiriye inama.','Ask which tests, measurements, and vaccines are recommended for you.'=>'Baza ibipimo, isuzuma n’inkingo bikugenewe.','Keep a note of your next appointment and where to go for care.'=>'Andika itariki yo kwisuzumisha itaha n’aho uzajya gushakira ubuvuzi.','Healthy pregnancy tips'=>'Inama zo kugira inda nzima','Choose varied, nourishing foods and drink safe water.'=>'Rya indyo itandukanye kandi ifite intungamubiri, unywe amazi meza.','Take supplements and medicines only as advised by your health worker.'=>'Fata inyongera n’imiti gusa nk’uko umukozi w’ubuzima yakugiriye inama.','Ask your health worker about safe activity, rest, and any concerns.'=>'Baza umukozi w’ubuzima imyitozo itekanye, kuruhuka n’ibindi biguhangayikishije.','Warning signs — seek care immediately'=>'Ibimenyetso by’akaga — hita ushaka ubuvuzi','Vaginal bleeding or severe abdominal pain.'=>'Kuva amaraso mu gitsina cyangwa kuribwa cyane mu nda.','Severe headache, blurred vision, or sudden swelling.'=>'Kubabara umutwe cyane, kureba ibicyezicyezi cyangwa kubyimba bitunguranye.','A change in your baby’s movements, when you can usually feel them.'=>'Guhinduka kw’ingendo z’umwana igihe usanzwe uzumva.','Fever, serious injury, or any sudden worrying change.'=>'Umuriro, gukomereka bikomeye cyangwa impinduka iyo ari yo yose iguhangayikishije.','Do not wait for a message reply if you think you need urgent help.'=>'Ntutegereze igisubizo cy’ubutumwa niba ukeneye ubufasha bwihutirwa.','My journey at a glance'=>'Urugendo rwanjye muri make','Confirm pregnancy'=>'Kwemeza ko utwite','Start antenatal care'=>'Gutangira kwisuzumisha inda','Growth checks as advised'=>'Gupimisha imikurire nk’uko wagiriwe inama','Prepare for delivery'=>'Kwitegura kubyara','Give birth with skilled care'=>'Kubyara ufashijwe n’ababifitiye ubumenyi','Postnatal care for you and your baby'=>'Kwitabwaho nyuma yo kubyara wowe n’umwana','This roadmap is general information, not a personal diagnosis or care plan. Follow the advice of your health professional.'=>'Iyi gahunda ni amakuru rusange, si isuzuma cyangwa gahunda yihariye y’ubuvuzi. Kurikiza inama z’umukozi w’ubuzima.'
    ];
    $rw += ['Pregnancy roadmap'=>'Gahunda y’igihe cy’inda','No active pregnancy episode is recorded for this mother.'=>'Nta makuru y’inda ikiri gukurikirwa yanditswe kuri uyu mubyeyi.'];
